			<description>September is Campus Fire Safety Month, and this is a great time to review best practices on how to stay safe!&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Fairview Fire District and Campus Safety are working together to help raise awareness about the dangers of fires.  Each Wednesday, during activity hour (11 a.m. – 1 p.m.), representatives from the Fairview FD and Campus Safety will be stationed throughout the campus to share fire...</description>
			<fullDescription>September is Campus Fire Safety Month, and this is a great time to review best practices on how to stay safe!&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Fairview Fire District and Campus Safety are working together to help raise awareness about the dangers of fires.  Each Wednesday, during activity hour (11 a.m. – 1 p.m.), representatives from the Fairview FD and Campus Safety will be stationed throughout the campus to share fire safety tips. We invite you to stop by and join the conversation.  There will be giveaways and a chance to win many cool prizes. All winners will be announced at the end of each day by way of Instagram/Facebook.</fullDescription>
