			<title>Vaccine Clinics</title>
			<description>Health Services is pleased to announce the Fall 2026 Vaccine Clinics.  We are partnering with Acme Pharmacy again this year,  to provide convenient, on-site vaccination services to help you protect your health.  A wide variety of vaccines are available at the vaccine clinics, including this year’s Influenza and COVID-19 vaccines. &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Vaccine Clinics will be held in the Student Center o...</description>
			<fullDescription>Health Services is pleased to announce the Fall 2026 Vaccine Clinics.  We are partnering with Acme Pharmacy again this year,  to provide convenient, on-site vaccination services to help you protect your health.  A wide variety of vaccines are available at the vaccine clinics, including this year’s Influenza and COVID-19 vaccines. &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The Vaccine Clinics will be held in the Student Center on the 3rd floor (Student Lounge), on Wednesdays from 11 am to 2 pm on the following dates:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;September 16 and 30&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;October 14 and 28&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;November 4 and 18&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Please register at least 24 hours before the date you plan to visit the vaccine clinic by scanning the QR code on the flyer or by visiting:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;https://www.acmemarkets.com/vaccinations/group-clinic/Marist-2026&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;You must bring your insurance card and a method of payment for any applicable copays to your visit.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA; &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Hope to see you all at the Vaccine Clinics this Fall!</fullDescription>
			<eventPhoto>/upload/marist/2026/e3_image_upload_599692_Vaccine_Clinic_2026_Final_2660e485-aea7-4803-bcf5-d75093dfe0ee_91593511.png</eventPhoto>
